      "message": "I think no, it does not, bitwise operation perform the same way no matter of endianness. `\u003c\u003c` will shift towards the most significant digit. Endianness is only relevant when you \"load numbers\" in \u0026 out of memory.",
      "revId": "82b6b949ab06441da92937728369e98bc630dd8c",
